 - 2026-06-20: PHASE A2 (ARC NORTH STAR; PRIMARY; operator MANDATORY; HEADLINE) -- REACH DEEPER LEVELS (the REAL per-level score lever). The agent solves only 1 of 8 levels on lp85; the leaderboard scores per-level min((human/agent)^2*100,115) index-weighted, so the score lever is solving MORE/DEEPER levels, NOT trimming actions. Diagnose + attack the L1->L2 barrier on a CORE game. Gate: a CORE game reaches L2 (core_efficiency up) OR a measured, actionable diagnosis of the barrier. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: l1_l2_barrier_diagnosed_depth_cap_honest_null; results/experiment_4524_reach_deeper_levels.json
