+- 2026-06-21: PHASE B1 (RESERVED INFRA) -- harden the PER-LEVEL EFFICIENCY gate (the real metric, shipped 2026-06-20): track deepest-level-reached + per-level-efficiency PER GAME as first-class, CI-guard it, and wire validate_canonical_baseline into --update-baseline (re-review caveat: an lp85 efficiency floor on persist, so a deflated baseline cannot disarm the per-game guard). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=shipped: nav_metric_first_class_ci_guarded; results/experiment_4527_nav_metric_harness.json
